Package: rpi-temp-alert
Version: 1.0.0-1
Section: monitoring
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Nikhil M B <nikhilmb002@gmail.com>
Depends: mailutils, bsdutils
Description: Raspberry Pi CPU temperature monitor for Ubuntu Server.
 Monitors CPU temperature and notifies logged-in users when it exceeds 61°C.
 Includes wall messages, email alerts, and systemd service support.

